Description: Windows 11-style Clipboard History Manager for Linux
 A modern, fast, bilingual clipboard manager for Linux (Wayland and X11),
 inspired by the Windows 11 Win+V clipboard experience.
 .
 Features:
  - Super+V / Ctrl+Alt+V shortcut to open clipboard history
  - Persian (فارسی) + English bilingual UI with instant RTL
  - Pin important items, emoji picker, kaomoji, and symbols
  - Local SQLite history with secret filter and privacy controls
  - Acrylic/glass UI with light, dark, and system theme support
  - Search with optional regex
  - Image clipboard support with thumbnail previews
